# Design Narrative
# Mechanic: Select and cast Signaling Roar, the Omen face of Riling Dawnbreaker, from hand.
# Forcing: Two Plains pay Signaling Roar's {1}{W} but cannot pay Riling Dawnbreaker's {4}{W}; its Soldier token triggers Impact Tremors for exact lethal.
# AI behavior: CastOmen is the only active cast offer and wins through a deterministic enter-the-battlefield trigger; passing every main-phase opportunity loses at cleanup.
# Failure modes:
#   WIN = Signaling Roar created the Soldier and Impact Tremors dealt exact lethal.
#   LOSE = The policy passed every opportunity, selected the unaffordable creature face, or failed to realize the Omen cast offer.
#   TIMEOUT = Omen selection, payment, token creation, trigger resolution, or priority failed to converge.
# Card roles:
#   Riling Dawnbreaker — supplies the unaffordable creature face and payable Signaling Roar Omen.
#   Impact Tremors — converts the created Soldier into an exact terminal outcome.
#   Plains — exactly two mana for Signaling Roar, insufficient for Riling Dawnbreaker.
# Protocol path: ActionsAvailableReq CastOmen -> PerformActionResp -> token creation -> triggered damage; no Omen gap is listed.
# Paired with: smaug-spew-flame-lethal.pzl

[metadata]
